  "reference": "Ruëëc 10",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ruec Tolä kɛnɛ Ya-ir",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔr Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk, cu Tolä gat pua gat Do-day raan Yi-tha-kar rɔ jiɛc ala luääk ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. Kä cuɛ ciɛŋ ni Ca-mir wi̱i̱ni päämni Ɛ-pa-rim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ruëc kä I-thɛ-rɛl kɛ run ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ diɔ̱k. Kä cuɛ cu li̱w, kä cua kony kä Ca-mir.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔrɛ cu ruëc ni Ya-ir raan Gil-yad cuɛ I-thɛ-rɛl ruac kɛ run ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ rɛw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ tekɛ gaat ti jiɛn diɔ̱k ti kɔat kɛ muɔ̱li ti jiɛn diɔ̱k. Tekɛ kɛ wi̱i̱ ti jiɛn diɔ̱k ti cɔal kɛ Ɣa-woth-ya-ir amäni walɛ, ti te ro̱o̱l Gil-yad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Ya-ir li̱w, kä cua jɛ kony kä Ka-mon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ciaŋ jiääk ji̱ Ka-mon kɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl jiäk lɛni nyɔk kɛ lätni nhiam Kuɔth Nhial, cukɛ pal ni kuoth Baal kɛnɛ kuoth Ac-tar-te, kuth ji̱ Thi-ri-ya, kɛnɛ ji̱ Dhi-don, kɛ kuth ji̱ Mo-ab, kuth ji̱ Am-on kɛnɛ kuth ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt. Ca Kuoth Nhial pa̱l ruëëc, kä /ca pal ɛ kɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cu Kuoth Nhial kɛ̈c ɛlɔ̱ŋ kɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, kä cuɛ kɛ la̱th tetni ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt kui̱c ɛmɛ kɛnɛ ji̱ Am-on kui̱c in dɔ̱ŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl däk ɛn runä nɔmɔ. Kɛ run wäl bädäk cukɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal tin te kui̱ kiɛɛr Jɔr-dɛn muun ji̱ Ɛ-mor min te kä Gil-yad yak ɛlɔ̱ŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Am-on jiɛth kui̱ Jɔr-dɛn wäkɛ nyiëëny kɛ ji̱ Juda kɛnɛ ji̱ Ben-ya-min kɛ ji̱ Ɛ-pa-rim. Inɔ cu I-thɛ-rɛl te yaakä mi bɛc ɛlɔ̱ŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl wiee nhiam Kuɔth Nhial wä kɛ i̱, “Ca̱kɔ ji̱ dui̱rikä, kɛ ɣöö ca̱kɔ ji̱ päl, ji̱n Kuothda, ca̱kɔ wä pal ni kuoth Baal.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl jiök i̱, “/Ciɛ ɣän ɛ nëë kään yɛ kä ji̱ I-jëp, kɛnɛ ji̱ Ɛ-mor, kɛ ji̱ Am-on, kɛ ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amäni ji̱ Dhi-don, kɛnɛ ji̱ Ä-ma-lek, kɛ ji̱ Ma-ɣon. Kä cua yɛ yak. Kä /cuarɛ wiee nhiamdä, kä cua̱ yɛ kän tetnikiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Cuarɛ ŋot päl yɛn ɣä, wiaa pal ni kuth ti kɔ̱ŋ. Inɔ ɣän /cä yɛ bi nyɔk kɛ ka̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiaa rötɛ nhiam kuthni tin cia mɛk. A yɛ ka̱nkɛ kä yaakdun.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl wee, “Ca̱kɔ duer, lätni kɔ kä mɔ guici mɔ. Ku kɔ lɛ luäk ɛn walɛ läŋ nɛy ni ji̱.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cukɛ kuth woc rɛydiɛn kä cukɛ pal ni Kuoth Nhial. Kä cuɛ bɛ̈c kä Kuoth ɛlɔ̱ŋ ɛn yaak ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ji̱ Am-on rɛmdiɛn rialikä, kä cukɛ ben pua̱t kä Gil-yad. Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl rɔ dol, kä cukɛ ben kä Midh-pa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu bööth ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ruac kamnikiɛn kä Gil-yad wä kɛ i̱, “Ɛŋa mi bi ko̱r tok kɛ ji̱ Am-on? Ɛn ram ɛmɔ ba kuäär ji̱ Gil-yad diaal.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
